#. docs:invoice_payments
msgid ""
"Comença quan s'aprova una factura, espera l'esdeveniment ``PaymentReceived``\n"
"del servei de pagaments i aleshores marca la factura com a cobrada. Si en 15\n"
"dies no arriba, passa a endarrerida i ho anuncia; un cobrament posterior el\n"
"tanca igualment."
msgstr ""
"It starts when an invoice is approved, waits for the ``PaymentReceived``\n"
"event from the payment service and then marks the invoice as paid. If it\n"
"doesn't arrive within 15 days, it becomes overdue and announces it; a later\n"
"payment still closes it."

